[32m+[m[32m# Offline AI Video Production Studio — Master Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Author : Mohit Singh**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Vision[m
[32m+[m[32mA private, single-user, fully offline, open-source Windows desktop application for anime and realistic video production, using image-first scene generation, local multimodal AI, audio, sequencing, preview and final rendering up to 1080p.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Principles[m
[32m+[m[32m- Offline-first; no cloud dependency during normal operation.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Single local user.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Windows-only target.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Python 3.11.15.[m
[32m+[m[32m- PySide6 desktop UI.[m
[32m+[m[32m- PostgreSQL + pgvector.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Large media stays on the project filesystem.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Projects live on user-selected external storage.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Production and training are isolated.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Model versions are explicit and reproducible.[m
[32m+[m[32m- New ideas may evolve the architecture through review.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Layers[m
[32m+[m[32mUI -> Application Services -> Domain -> AI Orchestrator / Infrastructure.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMajor domains: projects, stories, characters, scenes, shots, assets, production, knowledge, training, continuity, models and hardware.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## AI boundary[m
[32m+[m[32mApplication code requests capabilities through an AI orchestrator and model adapters rather than hard-coding model implementations.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Storage boundary[m
[32m+[m[32mPostgreSQL stores metadata, relationships, production state, model registry records, training records and embeddings. Project files store images, audio, video, documents, datasets, previews and exports.[m
