[32m+[m[32m# Training Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Author : Mohit Singh**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTraining is an independent studio. Active production model snapshots must never be silently modified by training.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mData -> Approval -> Candidate -> Dataset Version -> Training -> Checkpoint -> Evaluation -> Model Registry -> Promotion[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPotential training categories include story/narrative, character identity, visual style, image generation, voice/audio and other multimodal capabilities. Document retrieval and neural training remain separate concepts.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOnly approved and curated production data becomes a training candidate; raw generated content is not automatically treated as training truth.[m
